WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:03.180
To replace a number strip,

2
00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:07.570
start by completely removing
the sponge bar or the presser bar.

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:12.960
This is my ribber, but the main
bed is done the same way.

4
00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:22.280
Slip the old number strip out.

5
00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:37.000
Prepare the new strip by putting a bit

6
00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:42.140
of oil on your fingertip and spread a
thin amount on the backside of the strip.

7
00:00:42.170 --> 00:00:45.540
This will help keep it in place.

8
00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:50.600
Slide the new strip in place
and align it with the needles.

9
00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:58.200
Replace the sponge bar.

10
00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:02.440
And happy knitting.

